abstract: >-
  BirdNET+ V3.0 identifies 11,709 animal species (9,788 birds, plus insects,
  amphibians, mammals, fishes, reptiles, and an arachnid) and 16 non-animal
  sound classes in 32 kHz audio. Models are released in TorchScript, ONNX,
  LiteRT (TFLite), TensorFlow SavedModel, and Core ML formats. This repository
  provides reference code, examples, and benchmark results.
